cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Object Territories"
abstract: >-
  Fiji/ImageJ plugin for bounded Voronoi territory analysis, neighbourhood
  interactions, and kernel density maps from labelled objects. Handles 2D label
  images and genuine 3D label stacks, ImageJ ROI files and ROI sets, with
  Voronoi cells clipped to arbitrary region shapes and boundary cells flagged.
